<!--Gem_Page_Main_Editor--><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="gryffeditor"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1628928895818" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1628928895818" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">Frequently Asked Questions</h1></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1684780474319" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1684780474319"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1684780474323" data-id="1684780474323"><div class="element-wrap" data-label="Text Block" id="e-1557305832721" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1557305832721"><div class="elm text-edit gf_gs-text-paragraph-1"><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Here are the most common questions to help you understand your next step</span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>What is blended learning?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. </span>Study Active uses blended learning for all of its courses. Studying is done online, via a combination of e-learning and webinars for theoretical units whilst, if part of your course, practical units are delivered via flexible practical&nbsp;workshops.&nbsp;During your study you will have access to a wealth of interactive content that takes you through each step of your course, which can be accessed whenever and wherever you like as you learn at your own pace!</p><p><br></p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>Do I have to attend any sessions?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. <span style="color: #000000;">You can complete many units using our interactive online resources,</span></span> then you will need to attend practical workshops which focus purely on practical skills. These are always held at convenient times (usually on weekends) and are repeated each month throughout the year, so just choose what suits you best!</p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>What support will I get throughout my study?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. </span>As much as you like! We are there to support you through every step of your learning. We communicate with all of our students on a very regular basis to ensure they have the support they need via <span id="cloak86051df430200f0b94c608a598011917"><a rel="alternate">e-mail</a></span>, telephone, face to face and Skype.We are standing by to support you.</p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>How will I be assessed?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. <span style="color: #000000;">Course usually have coursework, practical exams and theory exams.&nbsp;For exams You&nbsp; will need to book onto an assessment day. We have regular slots on all days of the week so finding a suitable date is easy. On your assessment day you may take any theory and / or practical examinations.</span>&nbsp;</span></p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>How long does it take to complete a course?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. <span style="color: #000000;"><span>Usually it takes around 4-6 months&nbsp; (based on part time study) however&nbsp; some </span></span></span>students go for accelerated learning and qualify very quickly. This is up to you!&nbsp;</p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>Are these courses nationally recognised?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. </span>Absolutely yes! Study Active qualifications are all accredited by Active IQ, a nationally recognised awarding body. All our qualifications are also fully recognised by CIMSPA and will be nationally recognised throughout the fitness industry.</p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>Why are the courses so competitively priced compared to other providers?</h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. </span>Simple. We reduce our costs by offering all of our study via blended learning. This means we do not have to factor in the cost of classroom facilities, which brings the course delivery costs down and we pass this saving on to you!&nbsp; And for the record there is absolutely no difference in your certificate whether it is studied blended learning or classroom learning.</p></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>Do I have to pay in full?</h2><article class="ac-large"><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A.</span> You may pay in full or via interest free monthly instalments. You will have the&nbsp;option to&nbsp;set this up when enrolling online or over the phone.&nbsp;</p></article></article><article class="ac-large"><article class="ac-large"></article></article><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;"><br></span></h2><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q. <span style="color: #444444;"><span>Where can I find an enrolment form</span></span></span><span style="color: #444444;">?</span></h2><article class="ac-large"><p><span style="color: #0b5394;">A. </span>You can <a title="Enrol online here" href="/pages/enrolment" target="_blank">enrol online here.</a></p><h2><span style="color: #0b5394;">Q.&nbsp;</span>How can I contact you?</h2><article class="ac-large"></article><article class="ac-large"><ul><li>Email - <span id="cloaka46907d5e8179a957c7b1cf4d91ed58c"><a href="mailto:info@studyactive.co.uk">info@studyactive.co.uk</a></span></li><li>Call - <strong>0345 017 8733</strong> to speak to one of our friendly team</li><li>Complete the <a href="https://study-active-ltd.myshopify.com/pages/contact-us" rel="alternate" target="_blank">contact us form</a> and&nbsp;we will get back to you asap</li></ul></article><div></div><ul></ul></article><center><a href="https://studyactive.co.uk/" target="_blank"><img alt="" src="https://studyactive.co.uk/cdn/shop/files/Study_Active_logo_Strapline_blue_V1_230x.jpg"></a><br></center></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><script>window.__gemStoreData = {};window.__gemStoreData.gemKeyValid = {};window.__gemStoreData.gemKeyValid.bestWayAddToCart = 1;</script></div><div id="divContentBk"></div><!--End_Gem_Page_Main_Editor-->
